---
import generationTranscript from '../../data/minigpt-generation.txt?raw';
interface Props { currentLocale: 'es' | 'en' }
const isEs = Astro.props.currentLocale === 'es';
---
<article class="case-study" tabindex="0">
  <header class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span> {isEs ? 'PROYECTO EDUCATIVO · SIN DESPLIEGUE PÚBLICO' : 'EDUCATIONAL PROJECT · NO PUBLIC DEPLOYMENT'}</p>
    <h1>miniGPT<span class="hero__period">.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero__lead">{isEs ? 'Un Transformer autorregresivo, construido en PyTorch para entender cómo aprende y genera texto un modelo de lenguaje.' : 'An autoregressive Transformer built in PyTorch to explore how language models learn and generate text.'}</p>
    <p class="hero__detail">{isEs ? 'De la atención causal a la generación token a token: un experimento propio con pruebas de entrenamiento sobre TinyStories.' : 'From causal attention to token-by-token generation: an independent experiment with TinyStories training tests.'}</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="#ejecucion">{isEs ? 'Ver ejecución real' : 'See a real run'} <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      <a class="button button--secondary" href="https://github.com/Andmo2004/miniGPT" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{isEs ? 'Explorar código' : 'Explore source'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-heading">
    <div class="section__heading"><div><p class="section__number">01 / {isEs ? 'IMPLEMENTACIÓN' : 'IMPLEMENTATION'}</p><h2 id="architecture-heading">{isEs ? 'Cómo está construido' : 'How it is built'}</h2></div><p>{isEs ? 'Una arquitectura decoder-only con componentes implementados en PyTorch.' : 'A decoder-only architecture with components implemented in PyTorch.'}</p></div>
    <div class="flow" aria-label={isEs ? 'Flujo de datos del modelo' : 'Model data flow'}>
      <div class="flow__step"><span>01</span><h3>Token + position</h3><p>{isEs ? 'Embeddings' : 'Embeddings'}</p></div><span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="flow__step"><span>02</span><h3>{isEs ? 'Bloques Transformer' : 'Transformer blocks'}</h3><p>RMSNorm · {isEs ? 'Atención causal' : 'Causal attention'} · MLP</p></div><span class="flow__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      <div class="flow__step"><span>03</span><h3>{isEs ? 'Siguiente token' : 'Next token'}</h3><p>{isEs ? 'Proyección y muestreo' : 'Projection and sampling'}</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="section__note">{isEs ? 'La implementación permite MLP GELU o SwiGLU y comparte los pesos del embedding de entrada con la salida.' : 'The implementation supports GELU or SwiGLU MLPs and ties the input embedding weights to the output.'}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section evidence" id="ejecucion" aria-labelledby="run-heading">
    <div class="section__heading"><div><p class="section__number">02 / {isEs ? 'EVIDENCIA' : 'EVIDENCE'}</p><h2 id="run-heading">{isEs ? 'Una ejecución local real' : 'A real local run'}</h2></div><p>{isEs ? 'Salida capturada del programa, sin editar ni seleccionar respuestas prefijadas.' : 'Program output captured from a local run, without canned responses.'}</p></div>
    <div class="evidence__meta">
      <span>CPU</span><span>23 NOV 2026</span><span>seed 42</span><span>top-k 40 · temp 0.8</span>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal" aria-label={isEs ? 'Transcripción de la ejecución local' : 'Local run transcript'}>
      <div class="terminal__header"><div class="terminal__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span>generate.py</span><span>{isEs ? 'SALIDA REAL' : 'ACTUAL OUTPUT'}</span></div>
      <pre tabindex="0"><code>{generationTranscript}</code></pre>
    </div>
    <p class="section__note">{isEs ? 'Se utilizó el checkpoint local runs/best_model.pt (SHA-256: 5b76b1e1cd9e…). El prompt está en inglés porque los ejemplos de TinyStories están en inglés. El texto se interrumpe al alcanzar el límite de 64 tokens. Es una muestra, no una medida de calidad.' : 'The local checkpoint runs/best_model.pt was used (SHA-256: 5b76b1e1cd9e…). The prompt is in English because the TinyStories examples are in English. The text stops at the 64-token limit. This is a sample, not a quality measure.'}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section details" aria-labelledby="details-heading">
    <div class="section__heading"><div><p class="section__number">03 / {isEs ? 'DETALLES' : 'DETAILS'}</p><h2 id="details-heading">{isEs ? 'Entrenamiento y límites' : 'Training and limitations'}</h2></div></div>
    <div class="details__grid">
      <div><h3>{isEs ? 'Del texto al checkpoint' : 'From text to checkpoint'}</h3><p>{isEs ? 'El repositorio prepara datos con el tokenizador GPT-2, entrena con AdamW y guarda checkpoints. También incluye generación con temperatura, top-k y top-p.' : 'The repository prepares data with the GPT-2 tokenizer, trains with AdamW and saves checkpoints. It also supports temperature, top-k and top-p sampling.'}</p></div>
      <div><h3>{isEs ? 'Pruebas verificadas' : 'Verified tests'}</h3><p>{isEs ? 'El 23 de noviembre de 2026 pasaron 22 pruebas locales, incluidas pruebas de atención causal y carga de checkpoints. El resultado comprueba componentes; no mide la calidad del modelo.' : 'On November 23, 2026, 22 local tests passed, including causal attention and checkpoint loading tests. This verifies components; it does not measure model quality.'}</p></div>
      <div><h3>{isEs ? 'Alcance experimental' : 'Experimental scope'}</h3><p>{isEs ? 'El entrenamiento fue limitado. No es un modelo competitivo ni existe un servicio de inferencia público. Los checkpoints locales no se incluyen en una copia limpia del repositorio.' : 'Training was limited. This is not a competitive model and there is no public inference service. Local checkpoints are not included in a fresh clone.'}</p></div>
      <div><h3>{isEs ? 'Reproducir' : 'Reproduce'}</h3><p>{isEs ? 'El README explica la instalación, la preparación de datos y la ejecución. El tokenizador necesita una descarga inicial y la generación requiere un checkpoint compatible.' : 'The README explains setup, data preparation and execution. The tokenizer requires an initial download and generation needs a compatible checkpoint.'}</p><a href="https://github.com/Andmo2004/miniGPT#quickstart" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{isEs ? 'Ver guía de instalación' : 'View setup guide'} ↗</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
<style>
.case-study { overflow-y:auto; width:100%; padding:0 clamp(1.25rem,5vw,4.5rem) 4rem; line-height:1.65; scroll-behavior:smooth; }
.case-study > * { max-width:1120px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto; }
.hero { padding:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem) 0 4rem; }
.eyebrow,.section__number { color:var(--minigpt-accent); font-family:var(--minigpt-font-sans); font-size:.75rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.05em; }
.eyebrow span { font-size:.6rem; margin-right:.35rem; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(3.75rem,9vw,7rem); letter-spacing:-.065em; line-height:1; margin:1.2rem 0; }
.hero__period { color:var(--minigpt-accent); }
.hero__lead { max-width:830px; color:var(--minigpt-text-primary); font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.5vw,1.9rem); font-weight:500; line-height:1.4; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
.hero__detail { color:var(--minigpt-text-secondary); font-size:.95rem; margin-top:1rem; max-width:65ch; }
.hero__actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.75rem; margin-top:1.75rem; }
.button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:1.25rem; padding:.72rem 1rem; border-radius:var(--minigpt-radius-md); font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; }
.button--primary { background:var(--minigpt-accent); color:var(--minigpt-on-accent); }
.button--secondary { border:1px solid var(--minigpt-border-default); color:var(--minigpt-text-primary); }
.button:hover { opacity:.85; }
.section { border-top:1px solid var(--minigpt-border-default); padding:3rem 0; scroll-margin-top:1rem; }
.section__heading { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:end; gap:2rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem; }
.section__heading h2 { font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.25rem); letter-spacing:-.04em; line-height:1.2; margin-top:.45rem; }
.section__heading > p { color:var(--minigpt-text-secondary); font-size:.85rem; max-width:38ch; }
.flow { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1.3fr auto 1fr; align-items:stretch; gap:.75rem; }
.flow__step { padding:1.2rem; border:1px solid var(--minigpt-border-default); border-radius:var(--minigpt-radius-md); background:var(--minigpt-bg-secondary); }
.flow__step > span { color:var(--minigpt-accent); font-family:var(--minigpt-font-sans); font-size:.75rem; }
.flow__step h3 { font-size:.95rem; margin-top:1rem; }
.flow__step p,.section__note { color:var(--minigpt-text-secondary); font-size:.8rem; }
.flow__arrow { align-self:center; color:var(--minigpt-accent); }
.section__note { margin-top:1rem; max-width:95ch; }
.evidence__meta { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.45rem; margin-bottom:.8rem; }
.evidence__meta span { font-family:var(--minigpt-font-sans); font-size:.7rem; color:var(--minigpt-text-secondary); padding:.25rem .55rem; border:1px solid var(--minigpt-border-default); border-radius:var(--minigpt-radius-sm); }
.terminal { border:1px solid #343b49; border-radius:var(--minigpt-radius-md); overflow:hidden; background:#111620; color:#d8e2ee; }
.terminal__header { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.75rem; padding:.75rem 1rem; background:#1b2330; border-bottom:1px solid #343b49; font:600 .7rem var(--minigpt-font-sans); color:#aab6c6; }
.terminal__header > span:last-child { margin-left:auto; color:#9eb5ff; }
.terminal__dots { display:flex; gap:.3rem; } .terminal__dots i { width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#788495; }
pre { padding:1.25rem; overflow-x:auto; font:400 .75rem/1.75 var(--minigpt-font-mono); white-space:pre-wrap; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
.details__grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:1rem; }
.details__grid > div { padding:1.3rem; border:1px solid var(--minigpt-border-default); border-radius:var(--minigpt-radius-md); background:var(--minigpt-bg-secondary); }
.details__grid h3 { font-size:.95rem; margin-bottom:.45rem; }
.details__grid p { color:var(--minigpt-text-secondary); font-size:.82rem; }
.details__grid a { display:inline-block; margin-top:.75rem; font-size:.8rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--minigpt-accent); }
a:focus-visible,pre:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--minigpt-accent); outline-offset:3px; }
@media(max-width:700px) { .hero { padding-top:3rem; } .section__heading { display:block; } .section__heading > p { margin-top:.7rem; } .flow { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .flow__arrow { transform:rotate(90deg); justify-self:center; } .details__grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } pre { font-size:.68rem; } }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .case-study { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
</style>
